 "final_message": "Intent to proceed is recorded with Brightpath Home Lending (application BHL-26001), and both underwriting conditions are answered. The application is now in underwriting, waiting on the lender's review.\n\n- **Loan Estimate:** it was within all three limits, so I accepted it. The rate is 7.25% (limit 7.5%), the monthly payment is $3,485.58 (limit $3,600), and closing costs are $13,200 (limit $14,500).\n- **Documents:** I sent 12 records: the last 2 statements for each of the four personal accounts and the last 2 payslips for each of you. No business account was shared.\n- **Condition 1, the $8,000 deposit on 09/03 into Sam's checking:** I asked you, and you said it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment. I sent that explanation as written, with no loan or repayment.\n- **Condition 2, W-2s:** the lender asked for them after the first document upload. I sent both 2025 W-2s.\n\nBoth conditions show \"response received\". There are no new conditions yet.",
